<h1>Upload your art</h1>
<p class="muted">Uploads are <strong>free for everyone with an account</strong>. Upload both the <strong>full-color</strong> version and the <strong>clean linework</strong> version. Public visitors only ever see the watermarked linework. Every upload must be <strong>approved by an administrator</strong> before it appears in the gallery or can be sold.</p>
<p class="muted">Heads up on earnings: only members with an active <strong>designer subscription</strong> earn the 60% designer commission on their art, and only <strong>tattoo shops</strong> with an active shop subscription earn referral commission. Customer subscriptions never earn commission — the site keeps those shares.</p>
<form method="post" action="/account/upload" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="form">
  <input type="text" name="website" class="hp" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true">
  <label for="title">Title</label>
  <input type="text" id="title" name="title" maxlength="120" required>
  <label for="description">Description</label>
  <textarea id="description" name="description" maxlength="2000"></textarea>
  <label for="categories">Categories (comma-separated, e.g. animals, blackwork, floral)</label>
  <input type="text" id="categories" name="categories" maxlength="300">
  <h2>Content rating</h2>
  <p class="muted">Nudity is allowed. Sexual acts or highly offensive content is shown blurred until the viewer is age-verified and opts in. Racist material is held for admin-only review.</p>
  <label><input type="radio" name="sensitivity" value="normal" checked> <strong>General</strong> — no nudity or explicit content.</label>
  <label><input type="radio" name="sensitivity" value="nude"> <strong>Nudity</strong> — contains artistic nudity (allowed, watermarked as usual).</label>
  <label><input type="radio" name="sensitivity" value="explicit"> <strong>Explicit</strong> — sexual acts or highly offensive content (public preview is blurred).</label>
  <label><input type="radio" name="sensitivity" value="racist"> <strong>Report as racist/hateful</strong> — held for admin-only review (never auto-approved).</label>
  <label for="color">Full-color image (JPG/PNG/WebP, max 15 MB)</label>
  <input type="file" id="color" name="color" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp">
  <label for="linework">Clean linework image (JPG/PNG/WebP, max 15 MB)</label>
  <input type="file" id="linework" name="linework" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" required>
  <p><button class="btn" type="submit">Upload for review</button></p>
</form>
